{"id": "EUVD-2026-103067", "enisaUuid": "6a187791-5b51-38d1-97cd-91254ba95137", "description": "MrDoc through 1.1.1 contains a missing object-level authorization vulnerability in the ImportLocalDoc API that allows authenticated users to modify other users' documents and projects. Attackers can send PUT requests with arbitrary sort_data document ids to publish private drafts and reparent documents, or POST with arbitrary top_doc ids to inject documents.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:14", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T13:13:46", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/mrdoc-import-local-doc-api-missing-authz-cross-user-publish", "https://github.com/zmister2016/MrDoc/blob/v1.1.1/app_doc/views_import.py#L165-L182", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/mrdoc-through-1.1.1-missing-authorization-via-api-import-local-doc-endpoint"], "aliases": ["GHSA-x63c-25rw-gwj4", "CVE-2026-111645"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.22, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "31cb345d-6f96-36c6-9a3d-81878a4fec42", "product": {"name": "MrDoc", "vendor": {"name": "zmister2016"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.1.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "e89b4639-41c1-383a-834b-360b284cfaea", "vendor": {"name": "zmister2016"}}], "isExploited": false}